                                "sense_id": "1473fcb6-1ce8-31ae-857a-6ecace4b5a99",
                                "text": "Po lewej stronie alei miniecie targowisko."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0d223d81-aa7e-36c9-9c9d-7445491ff0c8",
                        "entry_id": "973ff87b-6934-3bba-9ea7-f4f607ec0ab0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "kupno i sprzedaż towarów mająca miejsce w wydzielonym miejscu w określone dni tygodnia"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "429e3365-2fbb-4702-81db-416a84c715ed",
                                "sense_id": "0d223d81-aa7e-36c9-9c9d-7445491ff0c8",
                                "text": "Zawsze w środy odbywa się tutaj targowisko."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.2\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a300e86b-e42e-37c8-bc30-ed3f4016a92e",
                        "entry_id": "973ff87b-6934-3bba-9ea7-f4f607ec0ab0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "stworzona okazja do nadużyć politycznych i korupcji"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "metaphoric"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c6fb2aa-b7f6-4928-809f-6678ca3f795c",
                                "sense_id": "a300e86b-e42e-37c8-bc30-ed3f4016a92e",
                                "text": "Wiedeń to targowisko urzędów, honorów, / Gniazdo ideologów, ojczyzna Doktorów…"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.3\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e5066ef7-a69d-4aec-831d-99ac75d7b857",
                        "source_entry_id": "973ff87b-6934-3bba-9ea7-f4f607ec0ab0",
                        "source_sense_id": "1473fcb6-1ce8-31ae-857a-6ecace4b5a99",
                        "target_lang_word": "marketplace",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "marketplace",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7109d8a0-db8a-3fad-9e7b-16b715382d73",
                                        "entry_id": "1cd8c8c8-0a47-3052-bc27-5c30b4a0e5eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An open area in a town housing a public market."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e976bb17-c4bc-3a0f-8aad-25863b379ba4",
                                        "entry_id": "1cd8c8c8-0a47-3052-bc27-5c30b4a0e5eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The space, actual or metaphorical, in which a market operates."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82264aea-1f1c-42a1-b12c-efd5c5ed5246",
                                                "sense_id": "e976bb17-c4bc-3a0f-8aad-25863b379ba4",
                                                "text": "Some high-street retailers were slow to enter the new digital marketplace of the Internet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c154b3cb-daca-35ad-8cfa-cccf88f0c39a",
                                        "entry_id": "1cd8c8c8-0a47-3052-bc27-5c30b4a0e5eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The world of commerce and trade."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1ecf2ab-6873-495a-810d-755cbcd5d126",
                                                "sense_id": "c154b3cb-daca-35ad-8cfa-cccf88f0c39a",
                                                "text": "Endorsing the liberal anti-interventionist credo that the marketplace should act as the \"site of verification,\" the advocates of white lead opposed government intervention for the sake of open economic competition, which they claimed revealed its true value and thus should be the sole determinant: \"When the railways were built, the stage coaches disppeared; they died a timely death. If zinc white is truly superior to white lead, it will kill us in the marketplace, but the government should not intervene.\" These were the words of Expert-Bezançon, in his February 1903 deposition to the parliamentary committee examining the bill for banning lead-based pigments in paint."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f44da564-1b2d-35d7-bf46-0d404c731bdd",
                                        "entry_id": "1cd8c8c8-0a47-3052-bc27-5c30b4a0e5eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A place or sphere for the exchange of anything, such as ideas or fashions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8b2e854-29d8-44b7-badc-5a225709cfc8",
                                                "sense_id": "f44da564-1b2d-35d7-bf46-0d404c731bdd",
                                                "text": "marketplace of ideas"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "370b89a0-566e-4bee-8895-bb4b64f17757",
                                                "sense_id": "f44da564-1b2d-35d7-bf46-0d404c731bdd",
                                                "text": "While political theory frequently appears condemned to nostalgic reflection, cultural studies often dulls its critical edge in the never-ending stampede to document the newest styles and counterstyles of the cultural marketplace."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ad6ef92-4a0c-432b-a33f-e2fdf666fbc7",
                                                "sense_id": "f44da564-1b2d-35d7-bf46-0d404c731bdd",
                                                "text": "So I have seen this controversy from both sides, and I truly believe that the most important factor is the preservation of the Internet's potential for becoming the new neutral marketplace of ideas that is so needed for the revitalization of American democracy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "99b60cdb-0272-441d-9cc1-4c1285544b08",
                        "source_entry_id": "973ff87b-6934-3bba-9ea7-f4f607ec0ab0",
                        "source_sense_id": "1473fcb6-1ce8-31ae-857a-6ecace4b5a99",
                        "target_lang_word": "market",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "market",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "821baa51-cb4e-39c5-b05e-294cb06d2044",
                                        "entry_id": "139c8e96-a421-3ef4-be42-4a32baef05fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make (products or services) available for sale and promote them."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13ec511a-1e3f-40d6-b4de-b943dff8e0f6",
                                                "sense_id": "821baa51-cb4e-39c5-b05e-294cb06d2044",
                                                "text": "We plan to market an ecology model by next quarter."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "833e1bd5-8883-35fa-af66-0840cbcef439",
                                        "entry_id": "139c8e96-a421-3ef4-be42-4a32baef05fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To sell."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d04f362a-8eb8-455f-a49c-307a5439c8b7",
                                                "sense_id": "833e1bd5-8883-35fa-af66-0840cbcef439",
                                                "text": "We marketed more this quarter already than all last year!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8925582d-3ca2-34e1-9e41-84078de438b6",
                                        "entry_id": "139c8e96-a421-3ef4-be42-4a32baef05fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To deal in a market; to buy or sell; to make bargains for provisions or goods."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5bb0c1e1-d7a4-35a8-bd11-1a7d0a2e1e5c",
                                        "entry_id": "139c8e96-a421-3ef4-be42-4a32baef05fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To shop in a market; to attend a market."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "273c6baa-7f05-4f1c-a96c-7fc09d54862d",
                                                "sense_id": "5bb0c1e1-d7a4-35a8-bd11-1a7d0a2e1e5c",
                                                "text": "We did a little shopping; but I cannot remember much of the town. It was Saturday night, and all Perth was marketing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "market",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "070bf4cc-9ed4-31cd-b77e-e80a9fd11e2a",
                                        "entry_id": "89f0c8ae-74d5-353d-bf03-1c3beba3f410",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A gathering of people for the purchase and sale of merchandise, often periodic at a set time."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a07a262-6146-46c2-a73b-372503ee2741",
                                                "sense_id": "070bf4cc-9ed4-31cd-b77e-e80a9fd11e2a",
                                                "text": "The right to hold a weekly market was an invaluable privilege not given to all towns in the Middle Ages."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69eede35-7e3d-4f3c-bee5-5c93188b6d97",
                                                "sense_id": "070bf4cc-9ed4-31cd-b77e-e80a9fd11e2a",
                                                "text": "There's a market every Thursday and Saturday in the town square."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5e837dc-2227-4a7e-afba-63d02d977792",
                                                "sense_id": "070bf4cc-9ed4-31cd-b77e-e80a9fd11e2a",
                                                "text": "The market is a process, actuated by the interplay of the actions of the various individuals cooperating under the division of labor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bb22eee4-0636-302d-93d0-d682caac5ca0",
                                        "entry_id": "89f0c8ae-74d5-353d-bf03-1c3beba3f410",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A relatively spacious outdoor or covered site where traders set up stalls, either temporarily or permanently or semi-permanently, and buyers browse the merchandise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "280ad04d-b3f7-42f5-9d85-47daad3244ae",
                                                "sense_id": "bb22eee4-0636-302d-93d0-d682caac5ca0",
                                                "text": "This site on North Street used to be the market, until it was redeveloped."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66ac1e86-0105-4daf-a7c0-97b3d85156a7",
                                                "sense_id": "bb22eee4-0636-302d-93d0-d682caac5ca0",
                                                "text": "‘I understand that the district was considered a sort of sanctuary,’ the Chief was saying. ‘[…] They tell me there was a recognized swag market down here.’"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5dd5d5c8-689c-4875-ab72-6bca00b4bbe5",
                                                "sense_id": "bb22eee4-0636-302d-93d0-d682caac5ca0",
                                                "text": "The San Juan market is Mexico City's most famous deli of exotic meats, where an adventurous shopper can hunt down hard-to-find critters such as ostrich, wild boar and crocodile. Only the city zoo offers greater species diversity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c645aba8-c3ca-30f3-b9b8-52d7dd8c12fb",
                                        "entry_id": "89f0c8ae-74d5-353d-bf03-1c3beba3f410",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any physical store selling groceries, such as a grocery store or convenience store."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ace8d15-4578-4a48-8c39-0f5c645e2faa",
                                                "sense_id": "c645aba8-c3ca-30f3-b9b8-52d7dd8c12fb",
                                                "text": "Stop by the market on your way home and pick up some milk."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74aa28a6-5c69-4949-abfe-e4a315cb1bb8",
                                                "sense_id": "c645aba8-c3ca-30f3-b9b8-52d7dd8c12fb",
                                                "text": "Mixes [such as cake mixes, pancake mixes, or sauce mixes] are sometimes a reasonable alternative and sometimes not. […] Pancake mixes often offer no advantages at all. Nonetheless, there are times when you would be foolish not to use a mix. Perhaps a domestic emergency occurs. Perhaps cupcakes must be brought to school tomorrow morning, but when you stop at the market on your way home from work, you cannot remember whether you have baking powder, cream of tartar, baking soda, nutmeg, cake flour, chocolate, or vanilla on your shelf, or you want to go through the “five items or fewer” line. So you buy the mix. Only a glutton for punishment would do otherwise."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f664e05b-f5dc-3a62-a62c-54fed5497005",
                                        "entry_id": "89f0c8ae-74d5-353d-bf03-1c3beba3f410",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A group of potential or current customers for one's product."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7af0a32e-f257-4062-9ba3-712959a6a2b3",
                                                "sense_id": "f664e05b-f5dc-3a62-a62c-54fed5497005",
                                                "text": "We believe that the market for the new widget will be the older homeowner."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39b887c0-ba4b-47d7-b239-2667238503d4",
                                                "sense_id": "f664e05b-f5dc-3a62-a62c-54fed5497005",
                                                "text": "Senior citizens are our core market at present, and we can't afford to alienate them as we explore other markets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70f980d0-aa4f-4750-b2d3-25dfb525db3c",
                                                "sense_id": "f664e05b-f5dc-3a62-a62c-54fed5497005",
                                                "text": "There is a third thing to be considered: how a market can be created for produce, or how production can be limited to the capacities of the market."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "84bdbb59-1a49-358d-97ea-b986010bd6eb",
                                        "entry_id": "89f0c8ae-74d5-353d-bf03-1c3beba3f410",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A geographical area or region where a certain commercial demand exists."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f40d0257-32bd-4b4f-9c92-12528094d10f",
                                                "sense_id": "84bdbb59-1a49-358d-97ea-b986010bd6eb",
                                                "text": "Foreign markets were lost as our currency rose versus their valuta."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e9e851f0-fa08-34f5-b257-f03a202ebced",
                                        "entry_id": "89f0c8ae-74d5-353d-bf03-1c3beba3f410",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A formally organized, sometimes monopolistic, system of trading in specified goods or effects."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97252c03-e833-41b4-b80b-6f3e2439ea7f",
                                                "sense_id": "e9e851f0-fa08-34f5-b257-f03a202ebced",
                                                "text": "The stock market ceased to be monopolized by the paper-shuffling national stock exchanges with the advent of Internet markets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3127c27a-ce76-4f25-9824-b0647567a17c",
                                                "sense_id": "e9e851f0-fa08-34f5-b257-f03a202ebced",
                                                "text": "As they were approaching bankruptcy from being knocked out of the calculator market, they began development on the first commercially available microcomputer, the Altair."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eddfb6de-3669-4874-9448-d1caee88a6bb",
                                                "sense_id": "e9e851f0-fa08-34f5-b257-f03a202ebced",
                                                "text": "If the takeover is approved, Comcast would control 20 of the top 25 cable markets, […]. Antitrust officials will need to consider Comcast’s status as a monopsony (a buyer with disproportionate power), when it comes to negotiations with programmers, whose channels it pays to carry."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b454df12-1543-3926-8bd8-2a5710b48a68",
                                        "entry_id": "89f0c8ae-74d5-353d-bf03-1c3beba3f410",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The sum total traded in a process of individuals trading for certain commodities."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13fd0dc5-14f6-3506-bf3f-1ee357dd6fd1",
                                        "entry_id": "89f0c8ae-74d5-353d-bf03-1c3beba3f410",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The price for which a thing is sold in a market; hence, value or worth; market value."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc6d9ac7-6f99-4e9f-82a0-d1f7df8400b6",
                                                "sense_id": "13fd0dc5-14f6-3506-bf3f-1ee357dd6fd1",
                                                "text": "Q: What's the market on such a thing, nowadays? A: Oh, no less than forty, I should reckon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e94e5175-6ab8-497e-b995-707cc7a902a8",
                                                "sense_id": "13fd0dc5-14f6-3506-bf3f-1ee357dd6fd1",
                                                "text": "What is a man\n If his chief good and market of his time\n Be but to sleep and feed?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "18937a88-ef62-47f0-9830-62e96a1fac9f",
                        "source_entry_id": "973ff87b-6934-3bba-9ea7-f4f607ec0ab0",
                        "source_sense_id": "1473fcb6-1ce8-31ae-857a-6ecace4b5a99",
